{"s":"SISE.IS","upd":"2026-11-13T07:55:25Z","profile":{"longName":"Türkiye Sise Ve Cam Fabrikalari A.S.","shortName":"SISE CAM","sector":"Industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","industry":"Conglomerates","industryDisp":"Conglomerates","country":"Turkey","city":"Istanbul","website":"https://www.sisecam.com","fullTimeEmployees":21801,"longBusinessSummary":"Türkiye Sise Ve Cam Fabrikalari A.S. manufactures and sells glass products. The company operates through six segments: Architectural Glass, Industrial Glass, Glass Packaging, Glassware, Chemicals, and Energy and Others. The company offers architectural glass products, such as flat, patterned, mirror, laminated, coated, solar power, and home appliance glass products; automotive glass products; and energy glass products. It also produces and sells glassware, as well as glass packaging products for various industries, including food, beverages, pharmaceuticals, and cosmetics; and retails glass, ceramics, porcelain, and wood and steel tableware and kitchenware, and home decoration items under the Life and Boutique concepts through Pasabahçe stores located in Turkey and international markets, as well as through online sales channels. In addition, the company produces and sells soda ash and chromium chemicals, vitamin K3 derivatives, and sodium metabisulfite to food, textiles, mining, water treatment, construction chemicals, and leather industries; glass fibers; and manufactures glass for automobiles, and light and heavy commercial vehicles. Further, it is involved in the mining of silica sand, feldspar, limestone, dolomite, kaolin, and quartzite; generation and sale of electricity; wholesale and trading of natural gas; glass recycling and waste collection activities; and production and trading of soda goods, as well as offers finance and investment, and insurance agency services. The company operates in Turkey, Germany, Italy, Bulgaria, Romania, Slovakia, Hungary, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Russia, Georgia, Ukraine, Egypt, India, the United States. The company was founded in 1935 and is headquartered in Istanbul, Turkey. Türkiye Sise Ve Cam Fabrikalari A.S. operates as a subsidiary of Türkiye Is Bankasi A.S.","quoteType":"EQUITY","exchange":"IST","fullExchangeName":"Istanbul","currency":"TRY","financialCurrency":"TRY","firstTradeDateMilliseconds":957940200000},"stats":{"marketCap":106949664768,"enterpriseValue":288604880896,"trailingPE":8.695864,"forwardPE":3.3653486,"pegRatio":0.67,"priceToBook":0.4412237,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.45929083,"enterpriseToRevenue":1.239,"enterpriseToEbitda":15.512,"profitMargins":0.03661,"grossMargins":0.26332,"operatingMargins":0.00063,"ebitdaMargins":0.0799,"returnOnEquity":0.025090002,"returnOnAssets":0.00017999999,"revenueGrowth":0.229,"totalRevenue":232858255360,"grossProfits":61316263936,"ebitda":18604951552,"netIncomeToCommon":8524271104,"operatingCashflow":13681110016,"freeCashflow":-52623273984,"totalCash":35857027072,"totalCashPerShare":11.974,"totalDebt":185573113856,"debtToEquity":60.365,"currentRatio":2.209,"quickRatio":1.188,"bookValue":81.002,"revenuePerShare":80.354,"trailingEps":4.11,"forwardEps":10.62,"epsCurrentYear":4.454,"epsTrailingTwelveMonths":4.11,"dividendRate":0.59,"dividendYield":1.63,"payoutRatio":0.2067,"exDividendDate":1780272000,"lastDividendValue":0.587618,"lastDividendDate":1780272000,"trailingAnnualDividendRate":0.0,"trailingAnnualDividendYield":0.0,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":1.4,"sharesOutstanding":2992436056,"floatShares":1209618068,"impliedSharesOutstanding":2992436056,"heldPercentInsiders":0.59785,"heldPercentInstitutions":0.03629,"targetMeanPrice":54.92475,"targetHighPrice":68.0,"targetLowPrice":42.08797,"targetMedianPrice":56.95,"recommendationKey":"buy","recommendationMean":2.22222,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":8,"averageAnalystRating":"2.2 - Buy","fiftyTwoWeekHigh":54.1,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":31.62,"fiftyDayAverage":37.7744,"twoHundredDayAverage":42.9794,"averageVolume":56661378,"averageVolume10days":38740611,"a